    {
      "why": "Primary family. 1 result/cycle satisfies the 32-request burst; m is the direct area knob (registers scale as ceil(N/m)+2 instead of N), so this family should own the low-luts_plus_ffs end of the front. Ranges cover the accuracy-feasible region (N>=13, W>=15) plus margin, and m spans the full 2..8 to expose the area/Fmax trade-off.",
