      "why": "Shared-datapath middle ground: k rotators/cycle gives a different area point (no per-stage register bank) and might reach the burst bound only at the extreme k=8, small N. Small share to test whether any (k,N) combination gets ceil(N/k)+3 small enough that 32 bursts fit in 0.44 us; expected to fail, but cheap to confirm.",
